#: ../../source/docs/modules/rcsetup.rst:3 d9794acd1b0a4ea5b77ac1056d49dba7
msgid "RC Setup"
msgstr "RC 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/rcsetup.rst:9 0adc9c86b96045c7a1b8a945eba02781
msgid ""
"The rcsetup module provides a method to calibrate the RC min/max/centre "
"value."
msgstr "rcsetup 模块提供校准 RC 最小值/最大值/中心值的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/rcsetup.rst:15 72d5e42144194b52bb7c6933e2097875
msgid ""
"Start/stop the rc calibration process for the first ``N`` channels. Omit "
"``N`` to calibrate all available channels."
msgstr "开始/停止前 ``N`` 个通道的 RC 校准过程。省略 ``N`` 则校准所有可用通道。"
